            I've been contributing to many projects in the past, like SCSS, vite and vitest, the HDF5 WASM runtime
            h5wasm, the supabase PostgREST Go client, The homassistant HomeAutomation system and more. Also building
            some openSource packages myself, see on the right.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <li><b>Others:</b></li>
        <ul>
          <li>
            I'm really into vegan cooking. You will love my vegan 'Hirschgulasch', Korean fried honey 'chicken' and the
            'Bienenstich'
          </li>
          <li>
            I love <b>Eslint</b>, <b>typescript-eslint</b> and <b>pnpm</b> so much, that I will annoy you with switching
            to my <a href="https://github.com/janis-me/starter" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              go-to monorepo setup.
            </a> Sorry
          </li>
          <li>I have read the typescript docs as a bedtime lecture</li>
          <li>I have two little cats and I <b>WILL</b> talk about them</li>
          <li>React should not be the most-used fronend library</li>
          <li>I have a <a href="https://janis.me/blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener">blog</a></li>
        </ul>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
