          <li>compatible with event emitters like emittery, the node event emitter etc.</li>
          <li>Stack: typescript, tsdown, pnpm, vitepress (docs)</li>
        </ul>

        <li>
          <b><a href="https://surimi.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">surimi</a></b>: CSS in TypeScript
        </li>
        <ul>
          <li>type-safe styles, themes and media queries, zero runtime</li>
          <li>this website is styled with it</li>
          <li>docs at surimi.dev</li>
        </ul>

        <li>
          <b><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@roulzhq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ROULZ</a></b>: Developer
